    source:{ name:"Dataiku", handle:"dataiku", platform:"web", kind:"lab" },
    text:"Dataiku launched Agent Management Sept. 25 -- a standalone product that inventories AI agents running across AWS Bedrock, Google Vertex, Microsoft Copilot Studio, Salesforce Agentforce, Snowflake Cortex and custom deployments, then risk-tiers them. CEO Florian Douetteau: \"Ask a bank how many servers it runs, and you get an answer to the decimal. Ask how many AI agents it's running, and you get a shrug or a guess.\"",
